# Never commit model/data/media artifacts, environments or credentials.
**/__pycache__/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*known_hosts*
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.safetensors
**/*.bin
**/*.glb
**/*.gltf
**/*.ply
**/*.obj
**/*.npz
**/*.npy
**/*.mp4
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.log
**/*.jsonl
**/environment/
**/runtime/
**/cache/

